3 audience winks broadly at $N and taps the side of $S nose.  'You won't tell, will you?  Good.'
1 say A fisherman, you say?  Then tell me, fisherman, which end of the cod goes in the basket?
2 emote looks at the cod.  He looks at the basket.  He looks at the cod again, and the house howls.
2 say The... pointy end?
