3 emote pops up from behind the crates with a bucket.  'Oi!  Some of us have to gut halibut in the morning!'
2 audience turns to $N with tears in his eyes.  'You, good friend, you have loved.  Tell her I am true!'
1 emote leans over the balcony.  'Is it true?  Are you a lord?  I could never love a lord!'
